it .env and add your API key:\\n# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-api03-...\\n```\\n\\n### Quick Installation Check\\n\\nRun the cell below to verify your environment is set up correctly:\u0026quot;","  },","  {","   \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\u0026quot;cell_type\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003emarkdown\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e,","   \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\u0026quot;metadata\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e: {},","   \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\u0026quot;source\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e**If you see any ❌ or ⚠️ warnings above**, please complete the setup steps before continuing.\u003cspan class=\"pl-cce\"\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/span\u003e**If anthropic SDK version is too old (needs 0.71.0 or later):**\u003cspan class=\"pl-cce\"\u003e\\n\u003c/span\u003e```bash\u003cspan class=\"pl-cce\"\u003e\\n\u003c/span\u003epip install anthropic\u0026gt;=0.71.0\u003cspan class=\"pl-cce\"\u003e\\n\u003c/span\u003e```\u003cspan class=\"pl-cce\"\u003e\\n\u003c/span\u003eThen **restart the Jupyter kernel** to pick up the new version.\u003cspan class=\"pl-cce\"\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/span\u003e---\u003cspan class=\"pl-cce\"\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/span\u003e### API Configuration\u003cspan class=\"pl-cce\"\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/span\u003eNow let\u0026#39;s load the API key and configure the client:\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","  },","  {","   \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\u0026quot;cell_type\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003emarkdown\u003cspan class=\"pl-pds\"\u003e\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e,","   \u003cspan class=\"pl-ent\"\u003e\u0026quot;metadata\u0026quot;\u003c/span\u003e: {},","   \u003cspan clas